WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.109 --> 00:00:07.176
Cora and Mo swam fast.

2
00:00:07.177 --> 00:00:10.825
The great white shark was right behind them!

3
00:00:10.826 --> 00:00:14.191
"This was a big mistake!" Mo said.

4
00:00:14.192 --> 00:00:19.311
"Let's just see what happens," Cora said.

5
00:00:19.312 --> 00:00:23.140
The arrow swam toward Rainbow Reef.

6
00:00:23.141 --> 00:00:25.141
Mo looked scared.

7
00:00:25.142 --> 00:00:29.529
"We can't lead the shark back home!"

8
00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:33.931
"It might scare the fish away," Cora said.

9
00:00:33.932 --> 00:00:38.286
Mo bit his lip. "I'm scared, Cora!

10
00:00:38.287 --> 00:00:47.170
Let's hide instead."

11
00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:58.483
Cora and Mo slipped into a cave.

12
00:00:58.484 --> 00:01:04.228
The shark sniffed around and then left.

13
00:01:04.229 --> 00:01:09.102
Cora sighed. "Let's go home.

14
00:01:09.103 --> 00:01:16.412
We'll think of another plan."

15
00:01:16.413 --> 00:01:19.282
They swam back to Rainbow Reef.

16
00:01:19.283 --> 00:01:22.438
The new fish were still there.

17
00:01:22.439 --> 00:01:31.529
Cora groaned. "There are even more of them!"

18
00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:35.352
Some fish bumped into Mo.

19
00:01:35.353 --> 00:01:37.818
Mo puffed up.

20
00:01:37.819 --> 00:01:41.056
"Ouch!" a fish cried.

21
00:01:41.057 --> 00:01:44.202
"You poked me with your spikes!"

22
00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:47.541
"How rude!" another fish said.

23
00:01:47.542 --> 00:01:52.213
Then someone shouted, "Shark!"

24
00:01:52.214 --> 00:01:56.857
The great white swam closer.

25
00:01:56.858 --> 00:02:01.047
"Its teeth look so sharp!" Cora thought.

26
00:02:01.048 --> 00:02:02.814
"Mo was right.

27
00:02:02.815 --> 00:02:05.740
We made a mistake!"

28
00:02:05.741 --> 00:02:09.415
Suddenly all the fish began to move.

29
00:02:09.416 --> 00:02:12.677
They swirled around and around.

30
00:02:12.678 --> 00:02:18.868
Cora felt dizzy. "What's going on?"

